### =====================================================
### Koleksi request untuk ekstensi VS Code "REST Client"
### (humao.rest-client). Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request.
### Ganti @baseUrl ke URL Vercel untuk menguji hasil deployment.
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @baseUrl = https://NAMA-PROJECT.vercel.app

### Info API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health check (API + database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Ambil semua data peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans

### Filter: status Terlambat
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?status=Terlambat

### Filter kombinasi + sorting + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?status=Dipinjam&member_name=budi&sort_by=due_date&order=asc&page=1&limit=5

### Filter rentang tanggal pinjam
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?loan_date_from=2026-09-01&loan_date_to=2026-09-30

### Detail peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/1

### Tambah peminjaman
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": "AGT-006",
  "member_name": "Handoyo",
  "book_isbn": "978-0-596-51774-8",
  "book_title": "JavaScript: The Good Parts",
  "book_author": "Douglas Crockford",
  "loan_date": "2026-09-29",
  "due_date": "2026-10-13",
  "notes": "Referensi praktikum PBB"
}

### Perbarui seluruh data (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": "AGT-001",
  "member_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "book_isbn": "978-602-03-3295-6",
  "book_title": "Laskar Pelangi (Edisi Revisi)",
  "book_author": "Andrea Hirata",
  "loan_date": "2026-09-26",
  "due_date": "2026-10-17",
  "notes": "Perpanjangan masa pinjam"
}

### Perbarui sebagian data (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "due_date": "2026-10-20",
  "notes": "Diperpanjang 3 hari"
}

### Catat pengembalian buku
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/loans/2/return
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "return_date": "2026-09-29"
}

### Hapus peminjaman
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/loans/6

### Contoh error validasi (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_name": "",
  "due_date": "29-09-2026"
}
